@startuml
title Sequence Diagram for Complete Workflow

actor User

participant "Local Machine" as Local
participant "Data Manager" as DataMngr
participant "Hyperparameter Tuning" as HyperTuning
participant "Model Training" as Train
participant "Model Evaluation" as Eval
participant "Summary Report" as Report
participant "Experiment Storage" as Storage

User -> Local : Start Workflow
User -> Local : Import Datasets
User -> Local : Define & Adjust Configurations

User -> HyperTuning : Hyperparameter Tuning
HyperTuning -> DataMngr : Request Preprocessing
DataMngr -> DataMngr : Preprocess Data
DataMngr -> HyperTuning : Return Preprocessed Data

HyperTuning -> HyperTuning : Define Hyperparameter Search Space
HyperTuning -> HyperTuning : Run Tuning Trials
HyperTuning -> Storage : Store Best Hyperparameters

User -> Train : Train Best Model(s)
Train -> Storage : Get Best Hyperparameters
Train -> DataMngr : Request Preprocessing
DataMngr -> DataMngr : Preprocess Data
DataMngr -> Train : Return Preprocessed Data
Train -> Train : Train Best Model(s) (Top n)
Train -> Storage : Store Trained Models

User -> Eval : Evaluate Best Model(s)
Eval -> Storage : Get Trained Models
Eval -> DataMngr : Request Preprocessing
DataMngr -> DataMngr : Preprocess Data
DataMngr -> Eval : Return Preprocessed Data
Eval -> Eval : Load Models
Eval -> Eval : Evaluate on Test Batches
Eval -> Eval : Calculate & Aggregate Metrics
Eval -> Storage : Store Evaluation Results

User -> Report : Generate Report
Report -> Storage : Get Evaluation Results
Report -> Report : Compare Metrics Across Models
User <- Report : Final Results

@enduml

